829165_1745429309770602_3173616434644146412_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CSPpGqLlH7kQ7kNvwFU389I&_nc_oc=AdpN0xDL8qUQlnYQmL8daebix8HJn3_ldBDaPjX6I50zKRfK-H9d_pVWsq4_c0JXVRk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFFxr_FCYeZT24Lh1IN9jqA3A6pmogCDuXcTKSG04GIeg&oe=6A7B16AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_24bit.png", "id": "779451085235427", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820887_779451088568760_4820113829668856600_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ss3E5RxpbfQQ7kNvwE4xS3s&_nc_oc=AdqgnCewqdJ8uHakkavfPN5v4wTM-_DH40K9j3WeqMxCuXKLULY0osf6_h_j7tIa4-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE0yZfw17ZS9oxe20nzURJzNnSYVQhJIR2KfDG5pai_Sg&oe=6A7B32F1"}, "display_name": "weelio DEMO", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is Weelio (DEMO), a VR experience designed around the thrill of speed. You dodge, strafe, and shoot obstacles along the way. This is a game for everybody, regardless of your VR experience: intuitive controls and no acceleration to avoid discomfort.\n\nAs you traverse the track, you strafe left and right to avoid obstacles and shoot at hostile drones. Manage your health, grab power-ups, and get to the finish line.\n\nWishlist the full game at https://www.meta.com/experiences/27240704588852632\n\nFor suggestions & bug reports head over to https://weeliovr.github.io/game/\n", "short_description": "This is Weelio (DEMO), a VR experience designed around the thrill of speed. You dodge, strafe, and shoot obstacles along the way. This is a game for everybody, regardless of your VR experience: intuitive controls and no acceleration to avoid discomfort.\n\nAs you traverse the track, you strafe left and right to avoid obstacles and shoot at hostile drones. Manage your health, grab power-ups, and get to the finish line."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/wee